    "description": "The Career Interview Listings API provides access to information on interviews related to application processes within the careers segment. This endpoint allows users to retrieve a detailed list of scheduled interviews, contributing to better management of the hiring workflow. Typical consumers include HR personnel and recruitment teams who utilize the data to track interview statuses and manage candidate progress. This API streamlines communication between candidates and interviewers by providing up-to-date information on interview timelines.",
